\p \v 24 \w Gideon|strong="H01439"\w* \w sent|strong="H07971"\w* \w messengers|strong="H04397"\w* \w throughout|strong="H03605"\w* \w the hill country|strong="H02022"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w to say|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Come down|strong="H03381"\w* \w against|strong="H07122"\w* \w the Midianites|strong="H04080"\w* \w and seize|strong="H03920"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w* ahead of them \w as far as|strong="H05704"\w* \w vvv|strong="H01012"\w* \w Beth-barah|strong="H01012"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w*.” \w So all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the men|strong="H00376"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w were called out|strong="H06817"\w*, \w and they captured|strong="H03920"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w* \w as far as|strong="H05704"\w* \w vvv|strong="H01012"\w* \w Beth-barah|strong="H01012"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w*. \v 25 \w They also captured|strong="H03920"\w* \w Oreb|strong="H06159"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and Zeeb|strong="H02062"\w*, \w the two|strong="H08147"\w* \w princes|strong="H08269"\w* \w of Midian|strong="H04080"\w*; \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and they killed|strong="H02026"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w Oreb|strong="H06159"\w* \w at the rock|strong="H06697"\w* \w of Oreb|strong="H06159"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and Zeeb|strong="H02062"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02026"\w* \w at the winepress|strong="H03342"\w* \w of Zeeb|strong="H02062"\w*. \w So they pursued|strong="H07291"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w the Midianites|strong="H04080"\w* \w [and] brought|strong="H00935"\w* \w the heads|strong="H07218"\w* \w of Oreb|strong="H06159"\w* \w and Zeeb|strong="H02062"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Gideon|strong="H01439"\w* \w on the other side|strong="H05676"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H03383"\w*.
\c 8
\s1 Gideon Defeats Zebah and Zalmunna
\p \v 1 \w Then the men|strong="H00376"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to [Gideon]|strong="H00413"\w*, “\w Why|strong="H04100"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01697"\w* \w have you done|strong="H06213"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* to us? \w Why did you fail|strong="H01115"\w* \w to call|strong="H07121"\w* us \w when|strong="H03588"\w* \w you went|strong="H01980"\w* \w to fight|strong="H03898"\w* \w against Midian|strong="H04080"\w*?” \w And they contended|strong="H07378"\w* \w with him violently|strong="H00854"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02394"\w*.
