\c 12
\s1 Jephthah Defeats Ephraim
\p \v 1 \w Then the men|strong="H00376"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w assembled|strong="H06817"\w* \w and crossed [the Jordan]|strong="H05674"\w* \w to Zaphon|strong="H06828"\w*. \w They said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to Jephthah|strong="H03316"\w*, “\w Why|strong="H04069"\w* \w have you crossed over|strong="H05674"\w* \w to fight|strong="H03898"\w* \w the Ammonites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05983"\w* - \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w calling us|strong="H07121"\w* \w to go|strong="H01980"\w* \w with you|strong="H05973"\w*? \w We will burn your house|strong="H01004"\w* \w down|strong="H08313"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w with you inside|strong="H00784"\w*!”
\p \v 2 \w But Jephthah|strong="H03316"\w* \w replied|strong="H00559"\w* \w -|strong="H00413"\w*, \w -|strong="H00376"\w* “\w My people|strong="H05971"\w* \w and I|strong="H00589"\w* \w had|strong="H01961"\w* \w a serious|strong="H03966"\w* \w conflict|strong="H07379"\w* \w with the Ammonites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05983"\w*, \w and when I called|strong="H02199"\w*, \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w you did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w save|strong="H03467"\w* \w me|strong="H00853"\w* \w out of their hands|strong="H03027"\w*. \v 3 \w When I saw|strong="H07200"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w you would not|strong="H00369"\w* \w save me|strong="H03467"\w*, \w I risked|strong="H07760"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03709"\w* \w my life|strong="H05315"\w* \w and crossed over|strong="H05674"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the Ammonites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05983"\w*, \w and the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w delivered them|strong="H05414"\w* \w into my hand|strong="H03027"\w*. \w Why then|strong="H04100"\w* \w have you come|strong="H05927"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w today|strong="H03117"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02088"\w* \w to fight|strong="H03898"\w* against me?”
