\p “\w I have done|strong="H06213"\w* to them \w what|strong="H03651"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w they did|strong="H06213"\w* to me,” \w he replied|strong="H00559"\w*.
\p \v 12 \w But they said|strong="H00559"\w* to him, “\w We have come down|strong="H03381"\w* \w to arrest you|strong="H00631"\w* \w and hand you over to|strong="H05414"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w the Philistines|strong="H06430"\w*.”
