\p \v 3 \w But Samson|strong="H08123"\w* \w lay there|strong="H07901"\w* \w only until|strong="H05704"\w* \w midnight|strong="H02677"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03915"\w*, \w when he got up|strong="H06965"\w* \w -|strong="H02677"\w* \w -|strong="H03915"\w*, \w took hold|strong="H00270"\w* \w of the doors|strong="H01817"\w* \w of the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w gate|strong="H08179"\w* \w and both|strong="H08147"\w* \w gateposts|strong="H04201"\w*, \w and pulled them out|strong="H05265"\w*, \w bar|strong="H01280"\w* \w and all|strong="H05973"\w*. \w Then he put [them]|strong="H07760"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w his shoulders|strong="H03802"\w* \w and took them|strong="H05927"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the top|strong="H07218"\w* \w of the mountain|strong="H02022"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w overlooking|strong="H05921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06440"\w* \w Hebron|strong="H02275"\w*.
\s1 Samson and Delilah
\p \v 4 \w -|strong="H01961"\w* \w Some time later|strong="H00310"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03651"\w*, \w [Samson] fell in love with|strong="H00157"\w* \w a woman|strong="H00802"\w* \w in the Valley|strong="H05158"\w* \w of Sorek|strong="H07796"\w*, \w whose name|strong="H08034"\w* \w was Delilah|strong="H01807"\w*. \v 5 \w The lords|strong="H05633"\w* \w of the Philistines|strong="H06430"\w* \w went|strong="H05927"\w* \w to her|strong="H00413"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Entice|strong="H06601"\w* \w him|strong="H00853"\w* \w and find out|strong="H07200"\w* \w the source of|strong="H04100"\w* \w his great|strong="H01419"\w* \w strength|strong="H03581"\w* \w and how|strong="H04100"\w* \w we can overpower|strong="H03201"\w* him \w to tie him up|strong="H00631"\w* \w and subdue him|strong="H06031"\w*. \w Then each one|strong="H00376"\w* \w of us|strong="H00587"\w* \w will give|strong="H05414"\w* you \w eleven hundred [shekels]|strong="H00505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03967"\w* \w of silver|strong="H03701"\w*.\f + \fr 16:5 \fqa 1,100 shekels \ft is approximately 27.6 pounds or 12.5 kilograms of silver.\f*”
