\c 18
\s1 The Danites Settle in Laish
\p \v 1 \w In those|strong="H01992"\w* \w days|strong="H03117"\w* \w there was no|strong="H00369"\w* \w king|strong="H04428"\w* \w in Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w [and]|strong="H03117"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01992"\w* \w the tribe|strong="H07626"\w* \w of the Danites|strong="H01839"\w* \w was looking for|strong="H01245"\w* - \w territory|strong="H05159"\w* \w to occupy|strong="H03427"\w*. \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w up to|strong="H05704"\w* \w that|strong="H01931"\w* \w time|strong="H03117"\w* \w they had not|strong="H03808"\w* \w come into|strong="H05307"\w* - \w an inheritance|strong="H05159"\w* \w among|strong="H08432"\w* \w the tribes|strong="H07626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*. \v 2 \w So the Danites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01835"\w* \w sent out|strong="H07971"\w* \w five|strong="H02568"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w from their clans|strong="H04940"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H07098"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w of|strong="H01121"\w* \w valor|strong="H02428"\w* \w from Zorah|strong="H06881"\w* \w and Eshtaol|strong="H00847"\w*, \w to spy out|strong="H07270"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w and explore it|strong="H02713"\w*. “\w Go|strong="H01980"\w* \w and explore|strong="H02713"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*,” \w they told them|strong="H00559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w*.
