\p \v 9 \w They answered|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Come on|strong="H06965"\w*, \w let us go up|strong="H05927"\w* \w against them|strong="H05921"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w we have seen|strong="H07200"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H02009"\w* \w and it is very|strong="H03966"\w* \w good|strong="H02896"\w*. \w Why would you fail to act|strong="H00859"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02814"\w*? \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w hesitate|strong="H06101"\w* \w to go there|strong="H01980"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00935"\w* \w and take possession of|strong="H03423"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w*! \v 10 \w When you enter|strong="H00935"\w*, \w you will come|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w an unsuspecting|strong="H00982"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w* \w and a spacious|strong="H07342"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w God|strong="H00430"\w* \w has delivered it|strong="H05414"\w* \w into your hand|strong="H03027"\w*. \w It is a place|strong="H04725"\w* \w where|strong="H00834"\w* \w nothing|strong="H00369"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08033"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03605"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01697"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w on earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w is lacking|strong="H04270"\w*.”
