\p \v 14 \w -|strong="H06030"\w* \w Then the five|strong="H02568"\w* \w men|strong="H00582"\w* \w who had gone|strong="H01980"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H07270"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of Laish|strong="H03919"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w their brothers|strong="H00251"\w*, “\w Did you know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w one of these|strong="H00428"\w* \w houses|strong="H01004"\w* \w has|strong="H03426"\w* \w an ephod|strong="H00646"\w*, \w household gods|strong="H08655"\w*, \w a graven image|strong="H06459"\w*, \w and a molten idol|strong="H04541"\w*? \w Now|strong="H06258"\w* \w think about|strong="H03045"\w* \w what|strong="H04100"\w* \w you should do|strong="H06213"\w*.”
