\p \v 22 \w After they|strong="H01992"\w* \w were some distance|strong="H07368"\w* \w from Micah’s|strong="H04318"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w*, \w the men|strong="H00582"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w in the houses|strong="H01004"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w near|strong="H05973"\w* \w Micah’s|strong="H04318"\w* \w house|strong="H01004"\w* \w mobilized|strong="H02199"\w* \w and overtook|strong="H01692"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the Danites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01835"\w*. \v 23 \w When they called out|strong="H07121"\w* \w after them|strong="H00413"\w*, \w the Danites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01835"\w* \w turned|strong="H05437"\w* \w to face them|strong="H06440"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to Micah|strong="H04318"\w*, “\w What is the matter|strong="H04100"\w* with you \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w you have called out such a company|strong="H02199"\w*?”
