\p \v 27 \w After they|strong="H01992"\w* \w had taken|strong="H03947"\w* \w Micah’s|strong="H04318"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w [idols]|strong="H00834"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w -|strong="H06213"\w* \w and his priest|strong="H03548"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w -|strong="H01961"\w* . . ., \w they went|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H05921"\w* \w Laish|strong="H03919"\w*, \w to|strong="H05921"\w* \w a quiet|strong="H08252"\w* \w and unsuspecting|strong="H00982"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w*, \w and they struck|strong="H05221"\w* \w them|strong="H00853"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06310"\w* \w with their swords|strong="H02719"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and burned down|strong="H08313"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00784"\w* \w the city|strong="H05892"\w*. \v 28 \w There was no one|strong="H00369"\w* \w to deliver them|strong="H05337"\w*, \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w [the city was ]|strong="H01931"\w* \w far|strong="H07350"\w* \w from Sidon|strong="H06721"\w* \w and had no|strong="H00369"\w* . . . \w alliance|strong="H01697"\w* \w with|strong="H05973"\w* \w anyone|strong="H00120"\w*; \w it|strong="H01931"\w* \w was in a valley|strong="H06010"\w* \w near|strong="H00834"\w* \w vvv|strong="H01050"\w* \w Beth-rehob|strong="H01050"\w*.
